<title>USA: Columbia Banking sees $612,000 Q3 charge.</title>
<headline>Columbia Banking sees $612,000 Q3 charge.</headline>
<dateline>TACOMA, Wash. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Columbia Banking System Inc said Thursday it would take a third quarter charge of $612,000 to conform to new federal regulations that recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>It said the charge is expected to be recovered within about three years through reduced insurance premiums.</p>
</text>
